  "lines": [
    "----",
    "",
    "",
    "Now let me also update the Run opts examples to use the new command syntax:",
    "",
    "**  edit** `/Users/cam/Dev/neovim-dev/omp.nvim/README.md`",
    "",
    "`````markdown",
    "     ",
    "     Run a prompt in a new session using the Plan agent and disabling current file context:",
    "     ",
    "     ```vim",
    "     :OmpRunNewSession \"Please help me plan a new feature\" agent=plan context.current_file.enabled=false",
    "     :OmpRun \"Fix the bug in the current file\" model=github-copilot/claude-sonned-4",
    "     :Omp run new_session \"Please help me plan a new feature\" agent=plan context.current_file.enabled=false",
    "     :Omp run \"Fix the bug in the current file\" model=github-copilot/claude-sonned-4",
    "     ```",
    "     ",
    "     ##👮 Permissions",
    "     ",
    "",
    "`````",
    "",
    "----",
    "",
    "",
    "README updated with the new nested command structure. The documentation now shows the new `:Omp` subcommand syntax and includes a note that legacy `Omp*` commands are still available by default but will be removed in the future.",
    "",
    "----",
    "",
    "",
    "can you rename Omp stop to Omp cancel (and rename the api call)",
    "",
    "[`README.md`](README.md)",
    "",
